          "body": "Jake White is reported to be eyeing a trusted Springbok ally to join his Fiji coaching staff, but the appointment is not confirmed in coverage so far. The hire would be the next piece of a set-up White is building before the November Nations Championship games against France, Ireland and Italy. Fiji's assistant picks remain the open question."
