          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Benhard Janse van Rensburg stood down from rugby indefinitely after two concussions",
          "body": "Borthwick has confirmed Benhard Janse van Rensburg will play no part in the autumn campaign, after a specialist advised a number of weeks away from contact rugby. The Bristol centre, who made his Test debut against Fiji in July, was knocked unconscious tackling England team-mate Henry Pollock in Bristol's defeat to Northampton. He misses the Australia, Japan and New Zealand Tests and finals weekend, and his next chance could come in the Six Nations."
        },
