          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Andy Farrell opts against replacing Garry Ringrose in Ireland's November squad",
          "body": "Andy Farrell has decided against calling up any replacement for Garry Ringrose, despite uncertainty over Tadhg Furlong's availability, the IRFU said on Tuesday. Furlong, 33, is due before a disciplinary committee after being cited for an alleged groin grab against Munster. Jimmy O'Brien is following return-to-play protocols after a concussion, and Sam Prendergast continues rehab from a wrist injury."
