          "kicker": "First home Test",
          "heading": "Italy host reigning world champions South Africa at Turin's Allianz Stadium",
          "body": "Italy's first home fixture in the Nations Championship is the opener against reigning world champions South Africa, played at Juventus' Allianz Stadium in Turin. The stadium was presented in September and marks the third consecutive year it has hosted international rugby. Quesada's side then face Argentina in Genoa and Fiji in Udine before the finals at Twickenham."
