          "kicker": "Centre cover",
          "heading": "Matías Moroni placed on standby as Santiago Chocobares awaits HIA outcome",
          "body": "Matías Moroni is on standby for the Ireland Test after Santiago Chocobares was left waiting on the outcome of a head injury assessment following a knock for Toulouse. Moroni is on 99 caps, so a call-up would give him the chance to reach 100, though he has not played for the Pumas since a facial injury against Australia in August. Chocobares, capped 31 times, is the player whose status decides it."
        },
        {
