          "kicker": "Eligibility call",
          "heading": "Ewen McKenzie predicts Mark Nawaqanitawase will end up in Wallabies jersey",
          "body": "Former Wallabies coach Ewen McKenzie has predicted Mark Nawaqanitawase will end up playing for Les Kiss' side, though the back three star has yet to choose between Australia, Fiji and Italy. The 26-year-old, who has 11 Wallabies caps with the last in 2023, has signed with the Saitama Wild Knights in Japan, and McKenzie wants more clarity first: \"I'm probably looking for him to make some clear statements, just to tidy a few things up.\" Ahead of the 2027 Rugby World Cup, that decision matters."
        },
